sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as User Browser
    participant GW as data-science-gateway<br/>openshift-ingress 443/TCP
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant IDE as IDE container<br/>127.0.0.1 app port HTTP
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant WH as workspaces-webhook-service<br/>443 to 9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Ctrl as workspaces-controller
    participant SCA as OpenShift Service CA
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>monitoring namespaces

    Note over Browser,IDE: Flow 1 - User accesses a workspace IDE, Gateway mode
    Browser->>GW: HTTPS /workspace/connect/ns/name/port/<br/>TLS 1.2+, platform OAuth/OIDC
    GW->>KRP: HTTPRoute ws-ns-name to WS-kube-rbac-proxy:8443<br/>TLS Service CA cert, Bearer token
    KRP->>API: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>get workspaces.kubeflow.org/name in ns
    API-->>KRP: allowed / denied
    KRP->>IDE: HTTP loopback<br/>X-Auth-Request-User / Groups
    IDE-->>KRP: IDE response
    KRP-->>GW: HTTPS response
    GW-->>Browser: HTTPS response

    Note over Browser,SCA: Flow 2 - Workspace creation and reconciliation
    Browser->>API: create Workspace CR<br/>User token + RBAC
    API->>WH: ValidatingWebhook /validate-kubeflow-org-v1beta1-workspace<br/>TLS cluster profile, failurePolicy Fail
    WH-->>API: allowed
    API-->>Ctrl: watch event Workspace
    Ctrl->>API: create StatefulSet, Service, SA, RoleBindings,<br/>kube-rbac-proxy CM/Service, CRB, ReferenceGrant, HTTPRoute<br/>SA token, TLS 1.2+
    SCA->>API: issue WS-kube-rbac-proxy-tls Secret<br/>annotation-driven

    Note over Ctrl,IDE: Flow 3 - Activity probe and auto-pause
    alt Jupyter HTTP probe
        Ctrl->>IDE: GET pod IP /api/status<br/>plaintext HTTP, no auth, bypasses sidecar
        IDE-->>Ctrl: last_activity
    else exec probe
        Ctrl->>API: pods/exec SPDY/WebSocket<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
        API-->>Ctrl: script output
    end
    Ctrl->>API: patch Workspace spec.paused / status

    Note over Prom,Ctrl: Flow 4 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>Ctrl: GET /metrics on metrics-service 8443/TCP<br/>TLS Service CA, Bearer token
    Ctrl->>API: TokenReview + SAR for /metrics
    Ctrl-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
